    "background": "Radox is a brand of personal care products.\n\nIn this study, you will be shown different design approaches for a product.\n\nThe aim is to understand how each design is perceived, which elements stand out, and which approach is preferred overall.\n\nYour responses will help guide the final design directions.",
    "main_question": "How appealing is this pack design to you?",
    "orientation_text": "Welcome!\nYou will be shown a series of pack designs, one at a time. Some may look similar, others different—this is intentional.\n\nPlease evaluate each design independently based on your immediate reaction. Do not compare designs. There are no right or wrong answers—we are interested in your personal response.\n\nFor each design, you will be asked:\n“How appealing is this pack design to you?”\nPlease respond using the 5-point scale.",
